		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Strahnbrad was a town of the eastern foothills, on the road between {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac{/link} and the lands of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link}. On the eve of the {link:third-war}Third War{/link}, orcs raided it for slaves, and Prince {link:arthas-menethil}Arthas Menethil{/link} came too late to save many of its people. Today it is a ghost town and the chief stronghold of the {link:syndicate}Syndicate{/link}. Its lords meet in its empty halls, and its old cells hold their prisoners. The {link:orcs}orc{/link} {link:gol-dir}Gol'dir{/link} was kept there as a slave, forced to dig and haul for his captors. The magistrate of {link:southshore}Southshore{/link} wants the signet rings of the nobles who hide among its thieves.]=],
		},
	},
})

