			text = [=[Growless Cave opens in the cold heights of central {link:alterac-mountains}Alterac{/link}. It is a den of mountain yetis, and a white yeti called Skhowl is sometimes seen near its mouth. The cave has a darker story too. The wizard {link:helcular}Helcular{/link}, who sought to become a lich, lit one of his three ceremonial pyres inside it: the Flame of Uzel. His apprentice in {link:tarren-mill}Tarren Mill{/link} still remembers the way. Hunters say that burning meat on the flame brings the great yeti Frostmaw down from the peaks.]=],
